msgid ""
"This app has full access to your system, including all <b>your files, browser history, saved passwords</b>, and more. It also has access to the internet, meaning it could send your data to outside parties.\n"
"\n"
"Because the app is proprietary, it can not be audited for what it does with these permissions."
msgstr ""
"Sellel rakendusel on täielik juurdepääs sinu süsteemile, sealhulgas <b>kõigile sinu failidele, brauseriajaloole, salvestatud paroolidele</b> ja muule. Samuti on sellel juurdepääs internetile, mis tähendab, et see võib sinu andmeid kõrvalistele isikutele saata.\n"
"\n"
"Kuna rakendus on suletud, ei saa auditeerida, mida see nende õigustega teeb."

msgid ""
"This app uses the legacy X11 windowing system, which allows it to <b>record all keystrokes, capture screenshots, and monitor other applications</b>. It also has access to the internet, meaning it could send your data to outside parties.\n"
"\n"
"Because the app is proprietary, it can not be audited for what it does with these permissions."
msgstr ""
"See rakendus kasutab vana X11 akendesüsteemi, mis lubab tal <b>salvestada kõiki klahvivajutusi, jäädvustada ekraanipilte ja jälgida teisi rakendusi</b>. Samuti on sellel juurdepääs internetile, mis tähendab, et see võib sinu andmeid kõrvalistele isikutele saata.\n"
"\n"
"Kuna rakendus on suletud, ei saa auditeerida, mida see nende õigustega teeb."

